30b9c>Delivery services in Edinburgh</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->From the historic streets of Old Town to vibrant neighbourhoods like Leith and Corstorphine, our delivery services in Edinburgh make sending parcels simple and efficient. Whether you’re sending nearby or across the UK, our range of options ensures you’ll find a solution that works for you.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Choose from our Courier collection, ParcelShops, or Lockers to get your parcels moving. With both Standard and Next Day delivery available, you can send with confidence, knowing your package will arrive on time.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Check out our great value prices to see how affordable it is to send with Evri in Edinburgh - or explore other cities, like our <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/courier-service-glasgow" rel="noreferrer" target="_self"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->courier services in Glasgow<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->, and our <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/courier-service-leeds" rel="noreferrer" target="_self"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->delivery serivces in Leeds<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--icon e-button--link card__button" data-gtm-track="button-Our prices" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/our-prices" data-v-e1e30b9c style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><div class="e-button__icon" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="che