rors":13742,"serverRendered":31,"path":13744,"pinia":13745},1784019897030,["ShallowReactive",4],{"content-page-subpath1:courier-service-edinburgh":5,"hero-banner-\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service-edinburgh":434},{"uid":6,"document":7,"postSlices":433},"courier-service-edinburgh",{"titleTag":8,"metaDescription":9,"canonical":10,"subpath1":11,"subpath2":21,"slices":22},"Courier Services Edinburgh | Next Day Delivery Edinburgh | Evri","Looking for a courier service in Edinburgh? Find cheap prices for sending parcels in your area with Evri. Standard and next day delivery options are available.","courier-service-edinburgh.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service-edinburgh",{"id":12,"type":13,"tags":14,"lang":15,"slug":16,"first_publication_date":17,"last_publication_date":17,"uid":16,"link_type":18,"key":19,"isBroken":20},"YhjzRRIAAC8A3CHH","subpath1",[],"en-gb","our-services","2022-02-25T15:18:32+0000","Document","4f3d3a88-b237-49ed-a16e-338d87ddac84",false,{"link_type":18},[23,38,90,174,250,342,358,370,383,403],{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":26,"primary":29,"id":35,"slice_type":36,"slice_label":37},"horizontalWidget","sktwi1xtmkfgx8626",[27],{"contentRight":28},{"link_type":18},{"heading":30,"includeInternational":31,"desktopBackground":32,"tabletBackground":33,"mobileBackground":34},"Courier services in Edinburgh",true,{},{},{},"hero_banner$57cdfb99-2cab-4025-ab33-aec2bf63671d","hero_banner",null,{"variation":39,"version":25,"items":40,"primary":42,"id":88,"slice_type":89,"slice_label":37},"default-slice",[41],{},{"CardImage":43,"CardAvatar":54,"CardTitle":55,"CardText":56,"ButtonText":84,"ButtonUrl":85,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":44,"alt":47,"copyright":37,"url":48,"id":49,"edit":50},{"width":45,"height":46},1000,667,"An Evri courier is handing three parcels to a man at his doorstep. They are both laughing as if a funny joke or anecdote was shared.","courier-service-edinburgh.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdKZbqstJ9-inz_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8362.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6zdKZbqstJ9-inz",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":53},0,1,"transparent","none","Delivery services in Edinburgh",[57,62,65],{"type":58,"text":59,"spans":60,"direction":61},"paragraph","From the historic streets of Old Town to vibrant neighbourhoods like Leith and Corstorphine, our delivery services in Edinburgh make sending parcels simple and efficient. Whether you’re sending nearby or across the UK, our range of options ensures you’ll find a solution that works for you.",[],"ltr",{"type":58,"text":63,"spans":64,"direction":61},"Choose from our Courier collection, ParcelShops, or Lockers to get your parcels moving. With both Standard and Next Day delivery available, you can send with confidence, knowing your package will arrive on time.",[],{"type":58,"text":66,"spans":67,"direction":61},"Check out our great value prices to see how affordable it is to send with Evri in Edinburgh - or explore other cities, like our courier services in Glasgow, and our delivery serivces in Leeds.",[68,76,78,83],{"start":69,"end":70,"type":71,"data":72},128,155,"hyperlink",{"link_type":73,"url":74,"target":75},"Web","courier-service-edinburgh.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service-glasgow","_self",{"start":69,"end":70,"type":77},"strong",{"start":79,"end":80,"type":71,"data":81},165,191,{"link_type":73,"url":82,"target":75},"courier-service-edinburgh.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service-leeds",{"start":79,"end":80,"type":77},"Our prices",{"link_type":73,"key":86,"url":87},"92c7dda3-1f1a-46ba-ad16-bb1a3290c20f","courier-service-edinburgh.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Four-prices","card$bba4824a-b0d7-419b-9c3a-2fcdc9f7e789","card",{"variation":91,"version":25,"items":92,"primary":169,"id":172,"slice_type":173,"slice_label":37},"photoListComponent",[93,111,129,149],{"title":94,"content":95,"isNumbered":20,"image":105},"Send a parcel in the UK",[96],{"type":58,"text":97,"spans":98,"direction":61},"Need to send a parcel from Edinburgh to anywhere in the UK? With Evri, it’s easy. Choose from our ParcelShops, Lockers, or Courier collection services to get your package to its destination quickly and affordably.",[99,104],{"start":100,"end":101,"type":71,"data":102},8,21,{"link_type":73,"url":103,"target":75},"courier-service-edinburgh.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend",{"start":100,"end":101,"type":77},{"dimensions":106,"alt":107,"copyright":37,"url":108,"id":109,"edit":110},{"width":45,"height":46},"An Evri Courier is walking down the street in a residential area with a parcel under his arm.","courier-service-edinburgh.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ69xhJbqstJ9-pU4_EVRI_LOCATION_01_0821.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z69xhJbqstJ9-pU4",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":53},{"title":112,"content":113,"isNumbered":20,"image":123},"Send a parcel internationally",[114],{"type":58,"text":115,"spans":116,"direction":61},"Looking to send parcels abroad? Evri delivers to over 200 countries and territories worldwide, ensuring your international shipments arrive safely. Visit our international page for more details on sending parcels from Edinburgh to anywhere in the world.",[117,122],{"start":118,"end":119,"type":71,"data":120},158,176,{"link_type":73,"url":121,"target":75},"courier-service-edinburgh.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services",{"start":118,"end":119,"type":77},{"dimensions":124,"alt":37,"copyright":37,"url":125,"id":126,"edit":127},{"width":45,"height":46},"courier-service-edinburgh.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ2VIYZbqstJ98uap_EvriInternationalCourierServices.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C2%2C6016%2C4013&w=1000&h=667","Z2VIYZbqstJ98uap",{"x":51,"y":128,"zoom":52,"background":53},2,{"title":130,"content":131,"isNumbered":20,"image":142},"Collect a parcel",[132],{"type":58,"text":133,"spans":134,"direction":61},"Our ParcelShops and Lockers make parcel delivery and collection easy for you. If you or a recipient isn’t available at the time of delivery, you can also choose to divert your incoming packages to a location that suits your schedule. With our ParcelShop to ParcelShop service, you can also send parcels directly from one ParcelShop to another. It’s the cheapest way for you to send and your recipient can collect their parcel any time within opening hours.",[135,141],{"start":136,"end":137,"type":71,"data":138},243,275,{"link_type":73,"url":139,"target":140},"courier-service-edinburgh.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fparcelshop-delivery","_blank",{"start":136,"end":137,"type":77},{"dimensions":143,"alt":144,"copyright":37,"url":145,"id":146,"edit":147},{"width":45,"height":46},"Woman collecting parcel from Post Office","courier-service-edinburgh.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ4qAQ5bqstJ99lHZ_DSCF4482.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C568%2C8192%2C5464&w=1000&h=667","Z4qAQ5bqstJ99lHZ",{"x":51,"y":148,"zoom":52,"background":53},568,{"title":150,"content":151,"isNumbered":20,"image":162},"Return a parcel",[152],{"type":58,"text":153,"spans":154,"direction":61},"Need to return an item? Our Couriers in Edinburgh are here to help. Visit our return a parcel page to find out how you can quickly and easily send your package back to the retailer.",[155,160],{"start":156,"end":157,"type":71,"data":158},78,93,{"link_type":73,"url":159,"target":140},"courier-service-edinburgh.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Freturn-a-parcel",{"start":156,"end":161,"type":77},94,{"dimensions":163,"alt":164,"copyright":37,"url":165,"id":166,"edit":167},{"width":45,"height":46},"ParcelShop store assistant is placing the customer's packageless items into a FSC-approved bag, ready to return to the retailer.","courier-service-edinburgh.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TIz5bqstJ9-TfE_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2344.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=47%2C0%2C5906%2C3939&w=1000&h=667","Z6TIz5bqstJ9-TfE",{"x":168,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":53},47,{"theme":170,"title":171,"description":37},"standard","Send, collect, and return parcels with Evri","list_block$a3df3991-452a-4275-ad05-63ba74761268","list_block",{"variation":175,"version":25,"items":176,"primary":238,"id":248,"slice_type":249,"slice_label":37},"3Column",[177,199,219],{"Title":178,"Description":183,"Image":187,"Label":37,"UrlText":181,"Url":194,"buttonDataGtmTrack":37,"SecondaryButtonText":37,"SecondaryButtonUrl":197,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":37,"ShowAppDownloadCta":37},[179],{"type":180,"text":181,"spans":182},"heading3","ParcelShops",[],[184],{"type":58,"text":185,"spans":186,"direction":61},"Our 9,000+ ParcelShops make it easy to send, collect, and return parcels all in one place. With free Print in Store services available, you can sort everything in just one visit. Use our ParcelShop Finder to locate the nearest store. Simply book your parcel delivery online or via the App and drop off at your most convenient location.",[],{"dimensions":188,"alt":189,"copyright":37,"url":190,"id":191,"edit":192},{"width":45,"height":46},"An Evri ParcelShop is in full view with its blue signage and a customer is walking up the accesssbility ramp and holding a parcel.","courier-service-edinburgh.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf__EVRI_LOCATION_03_3111.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=470%2C0%2C5460%2C3642&w=1000&h=667","Z6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf_",{"x":193,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":53},470,{"link_type":73,"key":195,"url":196},"9b6b7f8a-7a56-4440-b5cb-66b1b9313f4f","courier-service-edinburgh.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops",{"link_type":198},"Any",{"Title":200,"Description":204,"Image":208,"Label":37,"UrlText":202,"Url":215,"buttonDataGtmTrack":37,"SecondaryButtonText":37,"SecondaryButtonUrl":218,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":37,"ShowAppDownloadCta":37},[201],{"type":180,"text":202,"spans":203},"Lockers",[],[205],{"type":58,"text":206,"spans":207,"direction":61},"For added flexibility, our 24\u002F7 Lockers are conveniently located throughout Edinburgh. Simply book online or via the App, scan your barcode at the Locker, and leave your parcel in a secure slot for collection by our Couriers.",[],{"dimensions":209,"alt":210,"copyright":37,"url":211,"id":212,"edit":213},{"width":45,"height":46},"Customer holding parcel and standing outside at an Evri Locker, watching as their label prints out","courier-service-edinburgh.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C9%2C8164%2C5445&w=1000&h=667","Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb",{"x":51,"y":214,"zoom":52,"background":53},9,{"link_type":73,"key":216,"url":217},"ebec15e2-0ce9-4871-bbb4-3c6959a451da","courier-service-edinburgh.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers",{"link_type":198},{"Title":220,"Description":224,"Image":228,"Label":37,"UrlText":222,"Url":234,"buttonDataGtmTrack":37,"SecondaryButtonText":37,"SecondaryButtonUrl":237,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":37,"ShowAppDownloadCta":37},[221],{"type":180,"text":222,"spans":223},"Courier collection",[],[225],{"type":58,"text":226,"spans":227,"direction":61},"Can’t make it to a drop-off location? No problem! Our Couriers in Edinburgh can pick up your parcel directly from your home or office. Book online or through the App, and we’ll provide a 1-hour collection window, so you’ll know exactly when to expect us.",[],{"dimensions":229,"alt":230,"copyright":37,"url":231,"id":232,"edit":233},{"width":45,"height":46},"An Evri Courier smiling towards a customer after having completed a doorstep collection. The courier is holding multiple parcels, whilst the customer is holding a blue slip containing the details of the delivery.","courier-service-edinburgh.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDoZbqstJ9-cff_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4287.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6pDoZbqstJ9-cff",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":53},{"link_type":73,"key":235,"url":236},"6abd9ea7-2620-472e-b830-9d4078b6e078","courier-service-edinburgh.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service",{"link_type":198},{"SectionTitle":239,"SectionDescription":244,"theme":37},[240],{"type":241,"text":242,"spans":243},"heading2","How to send a parcel in Edinburgh",[],[245],{"type":58,"text":246,"spans":247,"direction":61},"We offer three simple ways to send your parcels in Edinburgh:",[],"article_link_module$bed260e1-ff3e-4d98-aae4-b4369a059dae","article_link_module",{"variation":251,"version":25,"items":252,"primary":338,"id":341,"slice_type":173,"slice_label":37},"listComponent",[253,266,278,290,302,314,326],{"title":254,"content":255,"icon":259},"Parcel tracking and notifications",[256],{"type":58,"text":257,"spans":258,"direction":61},"Check on the delivery stages of your parcel with end-to-end tracking for you and your recipient. We'll also send updates to your recipient and a 1-hour delivery window at no extra cost",[],{"dimensions":260,"alt":262,"copyright":37,"url":263,"id":264,"edit":265},{"width":261,"height":261},40,"Phone icon","courier-service-edinburgh.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd7cc2443-0047-4998-a550-fabf5e0f598a_phone.svg","Yh96FxIAACwA-Zse",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":53},{"title":267,"content":268,"icon":272},"Parcel cover",[269],{"type":58,"text":270,"spans":271,"direction":61},"Every parcel includes up to £20 free parcel cover. You can increase the value up to £999 and choose to add a digital signature for extra peace of mind",[],{"dimensions":273,"alt":274,"copyright":37,"url":275,"id":276,"edit":277},{"width":261,"height":261},"Money icon","courier-service-edinburgh.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F41d7371a-386e-4d75-a28e-2ea118d1d0af_money.svg","Yh96FxIAAC8A-Zsd",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":53},{"title":279,"content":280,"icon":284},"Easy to use tools",[281],{"type":58,"text":282,"spans":283,"direction":61},"Save time and easily book more than one delivery at once using our Bulk Send and Quick Send tools",[],{"dimensions":285,"alt":286,"copyright":37,"url":287,"id":288,"edit":289},{"width":261,"height":261},"Laptop icon","courier-service-edinburgh.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ff4479625-5e04-45e8-9a20-77fa5893b64e_laptops.svg","Yh96GBIAAC8A-Zss",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":53},{"title":291,"content":292,"icon":296},"Flexible printing options",[293],{"type":58,"text":294,"spans":295,"direction":61},"Print your postage labels at home or in-store for FREE using our Print in Store devices",[],{"dimensions":297,"alt":298,"copyright":37,"url":299,"id":300,"edit":301},{"width":261,"height":261},"Printer icon","courier-service-edinburgh.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ffdc990f7-2855-4f2e-9ddb-97e26bf3eac3_print+at+home.svg","Yh96GBIAAC0A-Zsk",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":53},{"title":303,"content":304,"icon":308},"Stress-free delivery experience",[305],{"type":58,"text":306,"spans":307,"direction":61},"With a 1-hour delivery window, up to 3 delivery attempts, and flexible diversion options, your recipient can enjoy a stress-free service without having to worry about missing their parcel. And the best part? These features come at no extra cost, giving you even greater value.",[],{"dimensions":309,"alt":310,"copyright":37,"url":311,"id":312,"edit":313},{"width":261,"height":261},"Friendly icon","courier-service-edinburgh.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F9fb9d950-2c3e-4a43-a975-c773dd47adf3_friendly.svg","YflB_BEAACEA8pcM",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":53},{"title":315,"content":316,"icon":320},"Photo confirmation of delivery",[317],{"type":58,"text":318,"spans":319,"direction":61},"We'll take a photo as proof of when a parcel has been delivered for your peace of mind and so your recipient knows where they can find it",[],{"dimensions":321,"alt":322,"copyright":37,"url":323,"id":324,"edit":325},{"width":261,"height":261},"Camera icon","courier-service-edinburgh.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F9ecd696f-d8c8-4a09-bdab-f2ed97d94895_cameras.svg","Yh96GBIAACkA-Zso",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":53},{"title":327,"content":328,"icon":332},"Trusted by big brands",[329],{"type":58,"text":330,"spans":331,"direction":61},"We’re trusted by some of the biggest names in retail like Hello Fresh, John Lewis, Next, Marks & Spencer, Shein, Wayfair and more",[],{"dimensions":333,"alt":334,"copyright":37,"url":335,"id":336,"edit":337},{"width":261,"height":261},"Success icon","courier-service-edinburgh.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8d947c5f-d007-4da4-b0c6-86691eda4240_success.svg","Yh96GBIAACwA-Zsm",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":53},{"theme":170,"title":339,"description":340},"Why choose Evri?","It’s not just great value prices we offer at Evri. When you choose to use our Couriers in Edinburgh, you also get all of the following benefits:","list_block$214cb5e7-f6a9-4679-b42a-f2810e1163e8",{"variation":39,"version":25,"items":343,"primary":344,"id":356,"slice_type":357,"slice_label":37},[],{"title":345,"bodyText":346,"isEco":20,"PaddingTop":20,"PaddingBottom":31,"NoMarginBottom":20,"hasButton":20,"buttonText":37,"buttonLink":350,"image":351},"Are you VAT registered?",[347],{"type":58,"text":348,"spans":349,"direction":61},"Your business can claim back taxes on any parcels you send across the UK with us - that makes your parcels even cheaper!",[],{"link_type":198},{"dimensions":352,"alt":37,"copyright":37,"url":353,"id":354,"edit":355},{"width":45,"height":46},"courier-service-edinburgh.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ3wUvJbqstJ99FvA_Smallbusinessowneronlaptop.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=2%2C0%2C7004%2C4672&w=1000&h=667","Z3wUvJbqstJ99FvA",{"x":128,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":53},"feature_banner$d996f8d3-3dcd-4098-adb6-b893b7ab4fe6","feature_banner",{"variation":359,"version":25,"items":360,"primary":362,"id":369,"slice_type":89,"slice_label":37},"cardNoImageWithCta",[361],{},{"CardAvatar":54,"CardTitle":363,"CardText":364,"ButtonText":37,"ButtonUrl":368,"IsEco":20},"Clear time frames",[365],{"type":58,"text":366,"spans":367,"direction":61},"Whether your parcel is staying in Edinburgh or heading across the UK, you’ll always know when to expect us. We provide a 1-hour time slot for collections and deliveries, so you can plan your day. If your recipient isn’t available, they can easily divert the parcel to a neighbour, safe place, or a ParcelShop or Locker for collection at their convenience.",[],{"link_type":198},"card$2385afaf-1b26-424a-815e-856d0d9694cb",{"variation":39,"version":25,"items":371,"primary":372,"id":381,"slice_type":382,"slice_label":37},[],{"heading":373,"description":374,"image":375},"We're TRUSTED by our customers & retailers","We provide delivery services for most of the UK's top retail brands, including Next, ASOS, boohoo, Missguided, PrettyLittleThing, John Lewis, Debenhams, eBay and Amazon.",{"dimensions":376,"alt":377,"copyright":37,"url":378,"id":379,"edit":380},{"width":45,"height":46},"View from the window of a house, an Evri courier is approaching and waving to a woman in the window. He is delivering a couple of parcels to the house.","courier-service-edinburgh.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdE5bqstJ9-inh_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7995.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6zdE5bqstJ9-inh",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":53},"trust_pilot$a71c0f08-0b02-4dc0-bb30-2537fe7b6a2a","trust_pilot",{"variation":39,"version":25,"items":384,"primary":385,"id":402,"slice_type":89,"slice_label":37},[],{"CardImage":386,"CardAvatar":54,"CardTitle":393,"CardText":394,"ButtonText":398,"ButtonUrl":399,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":387,"alt":389,"copyright":37,"url":390,"id":391,"edit":392},{"width":45,"height":388},665,"An Evri courier in high vis is smiling posing towards the camera with a parcel under their arm. The backdrop is a street of terraced houses in a rural British neighbourhood.","courier-service-edinburgh.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ69x25bqstJ9-pVF_EVRI_LOCATION_02_1771.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z69x25bqstJ9-pVF",{"x":51,"y":100,"zoom":52,"background":53},"Looking for work in Edinburgh? Become a self-employed Evri courier",[395],{"type":58,"text":396,"spans":397,"direction":61},"Discover your ultimate work-life balance by becoming a self-employed courier with Evri in Edinburgh. Whether you're after a straightforward side hustle or something closer to full-time work, you can start delivering parcels in your local area quickly and easily—finding a schedule that fits your lifestyle.",[],"Find out more",{"link_type":73,"key":400,"url":401},"9f95bcc6-3cc1-45b1-83bc-b05f21667fe9","courier-service-edinburgh.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fcareers\u002Fedinburgh-courier-jobs","card$bf8df476-bb23-437e-8f92-5108320d24bd",{"variation":39,"version":25,"items":404,"primary":430,"id":431,"slice_type":432,"slice_label":37},[405,411,424],{"questionTitle":406,"questionBody":407},"Does Evri cover all of Edinburgh?",[408],{"type":58,"text":409,"spans":410,"direction":61},"Yes, we deliver across Edinburgh, from the Old Town and New Town to areas like Leith, Morningside, and Portobello.",[],{"questionTitle":412,"questionBody":413},"Are there ParcelShops available in Edinburgh?",[414],{"type":58,"text":415,"spans":416,"direction":61},"You’ll find Evri ParcelShops in key locations across Edinburgh. Use our ParcelShop Finder to locate the nearest one to you.",[417,422],{"start":418,"end":419,"type":71,"data":420},72,89,{"link_type":73,"url":421,"target":75},"courier-service-edinburgh.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ffind-a-parcelshop\u002F",{"start":418,"end":4